// Components: functional blocks. They carry the same stats as armour (per large-grid block)
// plus their function, and have a fixed look made of parts. Every component works on bases and
// capital ships alike; cost is the large-grid recipe, smallCost the cheap small-grid one
// (common materials only, see grids.json).
//   function   core, cockpit, thruster, generator, fuel, container, door, light, turret,
//              cpu-extender or ladder
//   power      MW: positive generates, negative is drawn at full load
//   thrust     kN, pushing the structure forward (-Z) out of the exhaust at +Z
//   storage    SU added to the one shared storage of the structure
//   attach     faces other blocks can attach to ("all", "none" or a list such as ["-y"])
//   airtight   faces that seal air (doors: airtightOpen applies while open)
//   covers     faces that may hide the cell face behind them (for culling). Only ever a limit:
//              a face hides nothing unless an opaque part really covers the whole of it
//   collide    cell, parts (the part boxes) or none
//   parts      boxes or cylinders in cell units; style body (takes paint), dark, accent, glow,
//              glass; closedOnly parts belong to a door leaf
